{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41423","headline":"栢梁隔句韵诗 · 李建勳","name":"栢梁隔句韵诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不喜长亭柳，枝枝拟送君。\n惟怜北窗□，树树解留人。\n圆缺都如月，东西只似云。\n愁看离席散，归盖动行尘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李建勳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41423.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41423","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}